//=========================================================================
//  ***PRIVATE ***   (exported for internal use only)
//  Removes a child from the list of children of the specified provision node.
//  (provision nodes only)
//=========================================================================
//  Parameters:
//   i_hProvNode   - Handle of the provision node as it was returned by
